We have created this festival as an opportunity to continue to work with them.
This year's event includes the performance of Wanda Sykes, Kathy Griffin and Bill Maher, as well as "Stand Up for Heroes" (compete for Heroes), an annual musical-comedically comedic performance at Madison Square Garden, including Bruce Springsteen, Jon Stewart, Roger Waters and Bill Cosby.
Just as this festival has widened, the world of comedy has also widened.
Several comedians participating in this year's festival have emerged from non-traditional channels, such as shows in smaller radio and television companies such as Comedy Central, FX and Spike.
