It was right in the middle of the rock wall – 15 meters from the top and from the bottom.
He didn’t move his eyes during the rescue – he was totally frozen.
But he's all right now.
Then he got biscuits.
It was a very unusual exit.
It is unbelievable that someone saw the dog is unbelievable.
