Economia and the Center connect management.
For example, they will offer joint advertising
A new integrated newsroom of Economia in Karlín, Prague.
Economia has taken another step towards the transformation of Centrum holdings into its media house.
As of Friday, Economia and the Centre have shared top management.
"The unification of the organizational structure as well as the Personnel Union is crucial for the integration of both publishing houses into a common media house," comments Kamil Čermák, Vice-Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Economyuum and the commissioned CEO of Kamil Čermák.
Čermák, who will be at the forefront of unified management, will be supplemented by the Executive Director of Centrum Holdings Andreas Demuth.
