Věra Lhotská now manages a stand-aluctual corporate communication department.
Karel Žaloud is a joint financial director, the management of human resources for both publishing houses is led by Petra Slabá.
"The new organizing structure will, among other things, allow us to come to the market with a common offer of advertising products, to better connect the creation of the content of all published titles and, last but not least, to further significantly streamline the business management of the company," Čermák added.
Economia, owned by financier Zdeněk Bakala, entered into a contract for the purchase of Centrum Holdings and its Czech subsidiaries at the end of April this year.
Portfolio Centrum Holdings consists of the servers Aktuálně.cz, Žena.cz, web portals, an extensive e-mail base under Centrum.cz and Atlas.cz and SMB agency Najisto or a portfolio of almost two dozen other smaller websites.
